{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Enable tracing only after initialization succeeds.** `tracingEnabled` becomes true before the customer-supplied context extractor and span setup complete. If either throws, the plugin runner suppresses the start-hook failure, but subsequent hooks continue with incomplete trace state and can emit or flush orphaned spans. Mirror `InvocationOtelPlugin` by setting the flag only after successful initialization, and add an execution-plugin test with a throwing extractor.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs74mo1n","finding_digest":"d949a24e102df2cc9c9478c45f83a981d6649608ad4d06bf1fa8a95e3dbc3ae5","finding_id":"arf_v1_3fe2etqqfxzmzheupdcf7a5jqh","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts::executionotelplugin-oninvocationstart::premature-tracing-enable","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts::executionotelplugin-oninvocationstart::premature-tracing-enable","line":132,"observation_digest":"3732927bbc3f9752478fe752ca83c42cf4694f7199bc23310115e258c5a9d60e","observation_id":"aro_v1_g4zje654h6lver4p45jmva6eft","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-03T00:19:54Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ldc4a5l4actw7e5do4a3ns5gjw","reviewed_base_sha":"0ee6c027ca3b58f3bf270fdf4a9ac87b73752467","reviewed_head_sha":"1a8eb5bdbcb5147cd7bd7c2df2b64a12ddea6d17","reviewer":"codex","start_line":132,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":924},"record_id":"art_v1_sznrv6tdiqa5ooe6qbsfwh2pb4","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-03T00:19:54Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
